      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# \u26a0\ufe0f SYNTHETIC PoC DATA \u2014 NOT REAL SURVEILLANCE\n**EWARS-CSD malaria early-warning pilot \u00b7 20 Ethiopian woredas \u00b7 validation year 2024.** All figures are *generated synthetic test data* (`data_provenance='synthetic'`). Alarm detection is still being calibrated \u2014 alarms are **not yet reliable** (low sensitivity, false positives). Do **not** use for operational decisions."
